          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti bariite jennaani Samuelini Saulo ka mana gubba jiru yaame waan jed'eeni, Kai, si galcha. Sauloni kae, isaafi Samuelini dirati gabuani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri moga dira gahe jennaani Samuelini waan Sauloni jed'e, Namicha hojattu keeti kanaani, Nu dura dabri jed'i. Namichi dabre jennaani Samuelini waan Sauloni jed'e, Diqo miila d'aabad'u, waan Waaqi jed'e siti hima.",
          "type": "text",
